---
import SectionFrame from './SectionFrame.astro';
import SplitReveal from './SplitReveal.astro';
import MaskReveal from './MaskReveal.astro';
import Cite from './Cite.astro';
---
<section class="section problem" aria-labelledby="problem-title">
  <SectionFrame label="01 / PROBLEM" />
  <div class="container">
    <p class="eyebrow" id="problem-title">The problem</p>
    <SplitReveal
      as="p"
      class="display problem__statement"
      scrub
      text="Aging has *twelve* hallmarks, and one upstream layer connects them all: the signals carried in our plasma."
      highlight={['twelve hallmarks', 'one upstream layer']}
    />
    <div class="grid problem__cols">
      <div class="problem__text">
        <p>Aging is defined by at least twelve hallmarks, from genomic instability to stem cell exhaustion and chronic inflammation.<Cite n={1} /> Going after one with a single molecule does not solve the larger problem.</p>
        <p>As we age, the regenerative signals in our plasma fade and are replaced by maintenance and inflammatory signals. Our cells keep the hardware to regenerate. What changes is the software running on it.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="problem__fig">
        <MaskReveal shape="ring" class="problem__ring" spin>
          <img src="/figures/hallmarks-wheel.webp" width="1328" height="1328" loading="lazy" decoding="async"
            alt="Circular diagram titled Signaling environment: the twelve hallmarks of aging, grouped as primary, antagonistic and integrative, around figures spanning the human lifespan." />
        </MaskReveal>
        <figcaption class="figcap">
          <span class="label">FIGURE 1</span>
          <span class="italic-line">The signaling environment surrounds all twelve hallmarks of aging. Adapted from López-Otín et al., 2023.<Cite n={1} /></span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 28px; }
  .problem__statement {
    font-size: clamp(2.125rem, 1.3rem + 2.8vw, var(--step-4));
    line-height: 1.15;
    max-width: 22ch;
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
  }
  .problem__cols { margin-top: clamp(56px, 7vw, 112px); row-gap: 56px; align-items: center; }
  .problem__text { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: grid; gap: 22px; max-width: 560px; }
  .problem__fig { grid-column: 1 / -1; max-width: 520px; width: 100%; justify-self: center; }
  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .problem__text { grid-column: 1 / span 5; }
    .problem__fig { grid-column: 7 / span 6; justify-self: end; }
  }
</style>
